              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked whether the Attorney General\u2019s determination that the underlying sex offense could have occurred before SORNA was being questioned."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0273efe9385e019c653995a0116a2becbb2f0aee709aa8102f038ec12f1e1607",
