            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kennedy, justice Kennedy inquired whether registration is generally required even if the offense was committed before the registration act was passed in the State."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0273efe9385e019c653995a0116a2becbb2f0aee709aa8102f038ec12f1e1607",
